WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.303
- There she is, look at
how tall Nina is now.

00:00:02.303 --> 00:00:03.155
- I'm tall.

00:00:03.155 --> 00:00:05.566
- Dessert's coming, dessert's coming soon.

00:00:05.566 --> 00:00:09.470
I'm excited, I'm excited, I'm excited.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.486
Whoa, that's a little close!

00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:12.569
Now I'm scared.

00:00:12.569 --> 00:00:14.652
(whoosh)

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:18.141
(salsa music)

00:00:21.695 --> 00:00:23.865
(moped engine revs)

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:25.863
Alright, happy weekend everybody.

00:00:25.863 --> 00:00:26.696
- Hello.

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:29.809
- Once a quarter I take the people

00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:32.312
who are a part of my
Toronto Dance Salsa Team

00:00:32.312 --> 00:00:34.329
and I take them out for a treat.

00:00:34.329 --> 00:00:37.391
And last quarter we went, was it bowling?

00:00:37.391 --> 00:00:38.224
- [Nina] No.

00:00:38.224 --> 00:00:39.057
- No.

00:00:39.057 --> 00:00:40.553
Yeah, bowling, we did bowling

00:00:40.553 --> 00:00:42.613
and the meal at the restaurant.

00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:43.644
That was good times.

00:00:43.644 --> 00:00:46.905
And this year we were supposed
to go tubing, but it's--

00:00:46.905 --> 00:00:47.738
- But then.

00:00:47.738 --> 00:00:48.571
- What?

00:00:48.571 --> 00:00:50.557
- But then it's 11 degrees outside.

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:51.825
- Nina won't let me finish this story.

00:00:51.825 --> 00:00:53.102
Okay go, you tell the story.

00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:55.456
- It's 11 degrees outside,
it's too warm to go tubing,

00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:58.591
so we've decided to go
to this yummy restaurant.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.741
- Nina's very excited.

00:01:00.741 --> 00:01:02.074
- And, let's go.

00:01:02.941 --> 00:01:04.174
- Oh, wow.

00:01:04.174 --> 00:01:06.583
11 degrees for our
American friends watching,

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:07.681
I don't know what that is but

00:01:07.681 --> 00:01:09.821
we'll flash it right
here, what 11 degrees--

00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:13.850
In the middle of February, 11
degrees Celcius, it's crazy.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.936
- I don't get to go,
I'm staying and playing

00:01:16.936 --> 00:01:18.497
with Jeffrey and Stephanie.

00:01:18.497 --> 00:01:20.261
- You're going to have
more fun there anyway.

00:01:20.261 --> 00:01:21.103
Let's do it!

00:01:21.103 --> 00:01:23.686
(upbeat music)

00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:29.001
Alright, we're here, I made a mistake.

00:01:29.001 --> 00:01:32.499
Last time I paid for everybody
to go on the boat cruise,

00:01:32.499 --> 00:01:33.983
which was a lot of fun.

00:01:33.983 --> 00:01:37.232
And the time before that was
the lunch and the bowling.

00:01:37.232 --> 00:01:40.448
And so we're here, we switched
our plans from snow tubing

00:01:40.448 --> 00:01:44.078
because it's a glorious
day, I'm in shorts.

00:01:44.078 --> 00:01:48.128
And sandals, but that's been
my theme this winter anyway.

00:01:48.128 --> 00:01:50.851
Shorts and sandals, you've
got to get used the the cold.

00:01:50.851 --> 00:01:53.091
Embrace the cold, it makes you stronger.

00:01:53.091 --> 00:01:56.728
So this place, we came to,
what a couple weeks ago?

00:01:56.728 --> 00:01:57.561
- [Nina] Yeah.

00:01:57.561 --> 00:02:00.578
- The food was decent,
the food was really good.

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:01.411
But...

00:02:02.546 --> 00:02:03.778
The real reason to come

00:02:03.778 --> 00:02:06.031
is these amazing desserts that they have.

00:02:06.031 --> 00:02:10.248
Stacked toast with ice cream
and a whole bunch of yummy.

00:02:10.248 --> 00:02:11.374
And there were four of us

00:02:11.374 --> 00:02:13.589
and we couldn't finish it last time.

00:02:13.589 --> 00:02:16.468
And so I'm expecting some amazing visuals

00:02:16.468 --> 00:02:20.551
and for people to really
enjoy the time together.

00:02:21.402 --> 00:02:23.236
Come together as family

00:02:23.236 --> 00:02:27.312
and Nina set it all up so,
we appreciate and love her.

00:02:27.312 --> 00:02:28.176
Let's do it.

00:02:28.176 --> 00:02:30.759
(upbeat music)

00:02:33.508 --> 00:02:37.174
We're the first ones here,
we got this big table.

00:02:37.174 --> 00:02:38.964
Nina's excited.

00:02:38.964 --> 00:02:40.855
As we wait for people
to come and fill it up,

00:02:40.855 --> 00:02:45.004
let me show you the menu, let me show you.

00:02:45.004 --> 00:02:47.920
So this is the regular food,

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.692
it's all good, ramen.

00:02:49.692 --> 00:02:51.896
This is what we came for.

00:02:51.896 --> 00:02:55.233
Look at that, look at that toast.

00:02:55.233 --> 00:02:57.509
Yeah baby these things are huge.

00:02:57.509 --> 00:02:59.982
Nina's going to leave super full.

00:02:59.982 --> 00:03:01.283
100% happening.

00:03:01.283 --> 00:03:04.072
- Yeah, have to wear baggy clothes.

00:03:04.072 --> 00:03:05.107
- [Evan] She's going to leave,

00:03:05.107 --> 00:03:08.497
"Oh I'm so full, I can't eat anything."

00:03:08.497 --> 00:03:11.133
- Alex is here, Don is here,
long time no see buddy.

00:03:11.133 --> 00:03:12.236
- [Evan] Monica's all ready,

00:03:12.236 --> 00:03:15.153
