00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:18.395
- See my little pads now?

00:03:18.395 --> 00:03:20.635
I'm working so much and thinking so much,

00:03:20.635 --> 00:03:22.007
I'm wearing out my sweaters.

00:03:22.007 --> 00:03:24.039
So now I've got a little pad right here.

00:03:24.039 --> 00:03:24.872
- [Evan] How about your shoulders?

00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:25.705
- I'm planning, I'm planning.

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:26.874
- [Evan] You have pads
on your shoulders too.

00:03:26.874 --> 00:03:27.707
- Shoulders?

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.540
- [Evan] Yeah.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.018
- When I have a hard day and
I need to lean on someone,

00:03:31.018 --> 00:03:33.376
I got the shoulder pads too, you know?

00:03:33.376 --> 00:03:36.057
Sort of have to lean like
this sideways but whatever.

00:03:36.057 --> 00:03:37.411
Listen, stop judging.

00:03:37.411 --> 00:03:39.994
(upbeat music)

00:03:41.862 --> 00:03:43.659
