00:08:20.581 --> 00:08:23.127
Strawberries! (laughs)

00:08:23.127 --> 00:08:26.377
(upbeat ragtime music)

00:08:28.104 --> 00:08:31.137
Okay, so there's a quote I
read recently that I love

00:08:31.137 --> 00:08:33.521
and it just talks about
the spirit of really,

00:08:33.521 --> 00:08:35.630
focusing on yourself and being happy.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.633
When I think of you,
when I think of my family

00:08:37.633 --> 00:08:40.206
and over the last eight years
since I became a student,

00:08:40.206 --> 00:08:41.039
how...

00:08:42.573 --> 00:08:44.850
How grateful I am,

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:47.584
and I would never have
imagined myself being here,

00:08:47.584 --> 00:08:50.609
sitting with all of you, and...

00:08:50.609 --> 00:08:51.985
My one word is belong,

00:08:51.985 --> 00:08:53.262
I was always looking for a place

00:08:53.262 --> 00:08:54.891
where people wouldn't judge me,

00:08:54.891 --> 00:08:57.536
would make me feel like
I'm part of their family.

00:08:57.536 --> 00:09:00.672
So the quote says, or the quote goes,

00:09:00.672 --> 00:09:02.683
"Work like you don't need money,

00:09:02.683 --> 00:09:05.249
"love like you've never been hurt,

00:09:05.249 --> 00:09:07.731
"dance like nobody's watching."

00:09:07.731 --> 00:09:10.610
And so, gang, whenever I'm
at the studio, I'm dancing,

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.403
I feel like nobody's
watching, nobody's judging,

00:09:12.403 --> 00:09:14.238
and I hope you feel like that too.

00:09:14.238 --> 00:09:15.823
All the love I receive from you,

00:09:15.823 --> 00:09:17.380
it's like all the things in high school

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.296
and all the awkwardness
I've had in my life,

00:09:19.296 --> 00:09:20.223
it doesn't happen,

00:09:20.223 --> 00:09:21.568
and whenever I talk to you

00:09:21.568 --> 00:09:24.698
I always feel that it's
a genuine relationship.

00:09:24.698 --> 00:09:27.165
And I'm working at TDS because
I don't care about the money,

00:09:27.165 --> 00:09:28.417
I don't care about the power,

00:09:28.417 --> 00:09:29.675
I don't care about the attention.

00:09:29.675 --> 00:09:31.092
I care because...

00:09:32.017 --> 00:09:33.994
We're doing something bigger.

00:09:33.994 --> 00:09:36.792
We're doing something bigger
for ourselves, and for others,

00:09:36.792 --> 00:09:40.526
and every time I see any
of you talk to a student

00:09:40.526 --> 00:09:41.994
or you're talking to each other,

00:09:41.994 --> 00:09:44.063
and the light that lights up,

00:09:44.063 --> 00:09:46.149
and the light that lights up in me,

00:09:46.149 --> 00:09:49.642
it makes it a very special place.

00:09:49.642 --> 00:09:51.945
And so, thank you so much,

00:09:51.945 --> 00:09:53.961
for being part of my family.

00:09:53.961 --> 00:09:57.059
Thank you for letting me be
part of your family, your lives,

00:09:57.059 --> 00:09:58.647
and I just...

00:09:58.647 --> 00:10:00.953
It's incredible, and I'm
super proud of all of you,

00:10:00.953 --> 00:10:03.182
and just, what we have here.

00:10:03.182 --> 00:10:04.136
So thank you guys.

00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:07.083
(cheering and applause)

00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:09.333
(laughing)

00:10:11.313 --> 00:10:13.624
Real men cry, okay?

00:10:13.624 --> 00:10:15.117
Real men cry, Nina.

00:10:15.117 --> 00:10:16.170
- Alright, we're done.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.229
